<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY TO PUBLISH JAN C/A FIGURES WITH DELAY.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY TO PUBLISH JAN C/A FIGURES WITH DELAY.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Hungary said in a statement on Monday that the January data on the country's balance of payments, international reserves and foreign liabilities would be published on April 18.</p>
<p>The figures should have been published approximately one month earlier than April 18. The delay is due to the large-scale overhaul of the statistical system, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
